From: builder <builder@localhost>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 22:48:17 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 45/45] feat(cuda/p100): implement P5 Option A persistent
 cooperative megakernel for Qwen 27B dense FFN

- Fuse nodes [60..66] (RMSNorm, post-norm mul, gate, up, SwiGLU, down, residual add) into 1 persistent cooperative kernel across 56 SMs
- Vectorized MMVQ dot products with hardware DP4A and coalesced 16-byte memory loads
- Single-grid cooperative barrier synchronization across SMs
- Patch vecdotq.cuh get_int_b4 to support generic/shared memory dereference
- Fix IQ3_XXS scalar scale __ldg dereference on shared memory activations
- Retain >= 3.39 GB free VRAM cushion per P100 with 215k context + 4-draft MTP speculation
